B.awq=s(["The mobile calendar now leads the dashboard with larger day cells and compact record markers.","Tapping a date opens a draggable daily timeline with timed events sorted by start time.","The mobile month grid no longer captures range drags, avoiding conflicts with scrolling and page navigation.","Desktop split panels and mouse range selection remain unchanged."],t.s)
